-- title:
--   Original BV signed HJB budget gives genuine real perpetual Stieltjes L1 and exact dividendValue identity
-- statement:
--   Under original bounded-variation HJB and exact positive real-horizon signed closed stopped cash-plus-terminal budgets, the gradient lower bound follows from the HJB max identity. The Proved LIMIT-1 BV direct postpayment source bridge bounds the full expected dividendValue by a finite real ofReal(w x), so this ENNReal value is strictly below top. Proved original perpetual signed Stieltjes finite-value theorem then gives integrability of the original untruncated real payout over the true ruin-time paymentTimes and exact equality between dividendValue and the ENNReal.ofReal of that real expected payout. Initial and terminal atoms are preserved; neither terminal vanishing nor equality-in-law is required.

import Mathlib.Analysis.Calculus.ContDiff.Defs
import Mathlib.Analysis.Complex.Exponential
import Mathlib.MeasureTheory.MeasurableSpace.Defs
